; ==========================================================================
; STELLAR LITE-WRITER 2  -  a full-screen word processor   (VM1 @ $4000, SETSIZE 3)
; ==========================================================================
; Load, cold-boot, press a key. Type; words wrap at column 72. The status bar
; on line 24 shows the slot, line, column, bytes free, and MODIFIED.
;
;   arrows     move                 ^A / ^E   start / end of line
;   ^R / ^C    page up / down       ^T / ^B   top / bottom of the document
;   Backspace  delete back          ^D        delete forward
;   ^K / ^U    cut line / paste it  ^F        find (any case; Enter = again)
;   ^S / ^L    save / load slot 1-4 ^N        new document
;   ^V redraw  ^G help  ^X leave (offers to save)
;
; A document holds up to 3840 characters. The four slots share a 3838-byte pool,
; each taking only what its text needs. They survive a restart; reloading this
; file empties them.
;
; Plain VT100 only - no scroll regions, no VT102 insert/delete. Keys that arrive
; while the screen is being written are queued, not lost, and a held arrow key
; no longer types stray letters.
;
; THE SPLIT. The editor is the STELLAR program below (956 commands). A native
; 1802 engine at $4BE2 (2660 bytes, Firmware-Math/lw2_native.py) runs the terminal
; and the gap buffer's bulk moves, called with $F1 RUNMC.
; Needs SETSIZE ($F2) and RUNMC ($F1): V0061.28 on.
;
; MEMORY: bytecode $4000-$4BE1, engine $4BE2, messages $5646, key queue and
; variables $5F00, buffers $6000, text $6100-$6FFF, slot pool $7001-$7EFF.
; SETSIZE takes $4000-$6FFF; the pool uses VM4's block as well (SETSIZE cannot
; take a fourth block), with its START byte $7000 held at $00.
;
; HW-VERIFIED on the Elf2K (V0061.34), 2026-09-26 - Craig: "It works very well."
; (^W, write the text to memory, was then removed at Craig's request.)
;
; VERIFICATION (Firmware-Math/litewriter2_verify.py, V0061.34 image, a VT100 screen
; model and a UART with real timing - one byte, 9600 baud):
; all 15 scenarios PASS (sim, 2026-09-26): word wrap at 10 keys/s, scrolling
; both ways, paging, top/bottom, insert/delete/join/split, cut & paste, find
; (wraps), save/load/replace in the shared pool, full pool refused, a held
; arrow (no stray letters), typing during a full redraw (nothing lost), ^X
; save & leave, restart keeps the slots, a garbage pool reads as empty, dirty
; RAM starts clean. Plain VT100 only - the model rejects anything else.
;
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; DISASSEMBLY  -  commented out; the loader skips it
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------

; D 4000 CD             START                              Start of program, and run the label pre-pass
; D 4001 F2 03          SETSIZE 3                          Take $4000-$6FFF: VM1 plus the two blocks above it
; D 4003 11 0B 00 00    LOADXI R11 0000                    RB = 0: the index for variables
; D 4007 10 00 00       LOADAI 0000
; D 400A 2F 0B 1F 85    WRITEIDX R11 1F85                  SCRL := 0
; D 400E 10 00 00       LOADAI 0000
; D 4011 2F 0B 1F A0    WRITEIDX R11 1FA0                  MOD := 0
; D 4015 10 00 00       LOADAI 0000
; D 4018 2F 0B 1F A2    WRITEIDX R11 1FA2                  SDIRTY := 0
; D 401C 10 00 00       LOADAI 0000
; D 401F 2F 0B 1F A3    WRITEIDX R11 1FA3                  CDIRTY := 0
; D 4023 10 00 00       LOADAI 0000
; D 4026 2F 0B 1F A4    WRITEIDX R11 1FA4                  MSGSH := 0
; D 402A 10 00 00       LOADAI 0000
; D 402D 2F 0B 1F A5    WRITEIDX R11 1FA5                  LASTARR := 0
; D 4031 10 00 01       LOADAI 0001
; D 4034 2F 0B 1F A1    WRITEIDX R11 1FA1                  SLOT := 1
; D 4038 10 00 00       LOADAI 0000
; D 403B 2F 0B 1F 80    WRITEIDX R11 1F80                  the key queue is empty
; D 403F 2F 0B 1F 81    WRITEIDX R11 1F81
; D 4043 2F 0B 20 00    WRITEIDX R11 2000                  no search yet
; D 4047 2F 0B 20 80    WRITEIDX R11 2080                  nothing cut yet
; D 404B BD 08 FC       CALL N_U                           check the slot pool left from the last run
; D 404E 11 0E 18 79    LOADXI R14 1879                    TITLE
; D 4052 BD 08 7E       CALL N_S
; D 4055 BD 08 9C       CALL N_W
; D 4058 BD 0A D3       CALL NEWDOC
; MAIN:
; D 405B BD 09 0B       CALL GETKEY
; D 405E 2E 0B 1F A4    READIDX R11 1FA4                   MSGSH
; D 4062 81 00 00       TESTAI 0000
; D 4065 A0 00 76       IFTRUEI MA1                        a message stays up for one key
; D 4068 10 00 00       LOADAI 0000
; D 406B 2F 0B 1F A4    WRITEIDX R11 1FA4                  MSGSH := 0
; D 406F 10 00 01       LOADAI 0001
; D 4072 2F 0B 1F A2    WRITEIDX R11 1FA2                  SDIRTY := 1
; MA1:
; D 4076 2E 0B 1F A5    READIDX R11 1FA5                   LASTARR
; D 407A 81 00 00       TESTAI 0000
; D 407D A0 00 AD       IFTRUEI MA2                        after an arrow ...
; D 4080 2E 0B 1F 86    READIDX R11 1F86                   KWV
; D 4084 81 00 00       TESTAI 0000
; D 4087 A0 00 AD       IFTRUEI MA2                        ... a key that was already waiting ...
; D 408A 86 0A 00 41    TESTXI R10 0041
; D 408E A0 01 91       IFTRUEI ARROWKEY                   ... A-D is that arrow repeating
; D 4091 86 0A 00 42    TESTXI R10 0042
; D 4095 A0 01 91       IFTRUEI ARROWKEY                   ... A-D is that arrow repeating
; D 4098 86 0A 00 43    TESTXI R10 0043
; D 409C A0 01 91       IFTRUEI ARROWKEY                   ... A-D is that arrow repeating
; D 409F 86 0A 00 44    TESTXI R10 0044
; D 40A3 A0 01 91       IFTRUEI ARROWKEY                   ... A-D is that arrow repeating
; D 40A6 86 0A 00 5B    TESTXI R10 005B
; D 40AA A0 01 8A       IFTRUEI ES2                        ... and '[' is one that lost its ESC
; MA2:
; D 40AD 10 00 00       LOADAI 0000
; D 40B0 2F 0B 1F A5    WRITEIDX R11 1FA5                  LASTARR := 0
; D 40B4 23 00 AD       COPYXY R10 -> R13                  RD = the key
; D 40B7 11 08 00 20    LOADXI R8 0020
; D 40BB 89 A8          TESTLXY R10 < R8
; D 40BD A0 00 D3       IFTRUEI CTRL
; D 40C0 11 08 00 7F    LOADXI R8 007F
; D 40C4 89 A8          TESTLXY R10 < R8
; D 40C6 A0 02 18       IFTRUEI K_PRINT                    a printable character
; D 40C9 86 0A 00 7F    TESTXI R10 007F
; D 40CD A0 03 1F       IFTRUEI K_BKSP                     DEL = backspace
; D 40D0 B0 00 5B       GAL MAIN
; CTRL:
; D 40D3 86 0A 00 0D    TESTXI R10 000D
; D 40D7 A0 02 F7       IFTRUEI K_ENTER
; D 40DA 86 0A 00 08    TESTXI R10 0008
; D 40DE A0 03 1F       IFTRUEI K_BKSP
; D 40E1 86 0A 00 1B    TESTXI R10 001B
; D 40E5 A0 01 5B       IFTRUEI K_ESC
; D 40E8 86 0A 00 01    TESTXI R10 0001
; D 40EC A0 04 AD       IFTRUEI K_HOME
; D 40EF 86 0A 00 05    TESTXI R10 0005
; D 40F3 A0 04 B7       IFTRUEI K_END
; D 40F6 86 0A 00 04    TESTXI R10 0004
; D 40FA A0 03 CF       IFTRUEI K_DEL
; D 40FD 86 0A 00 12    TESTXI R10 0012
; D 4101 A0 04 EF       IFTRUEI K_PGUP
; D 4104 86 0A 00 03    TESTXI R10 0003
; D 4108 A0 05 2D       IFTRUEI K_PGDN
; D 410B 86 0A 00 14    TESTXI R10 0014
; D 410F A0 04 C0       IFTRUEI K_TOP
; D 4112 86 0A 00 02    TESTXI R10 0002
; D 4116 A0 04 CE       IFTRUEI K_BOT
; D 4119 86 0A 00 0B    TESTXI R10 000B
; D 411D A0 05 6B       IFTRUEI K_CUT
; D 4120 86 0A 00 15    TESTXI R10 0015
; D 4124 A0 05 9E       IFTRUEI K_PASTE
; D 4127 86 0A 00 06    TESTXI R10 0006
; D 412B A0 05 D7       IFTRUEI K_FIND
; D 412E 86 0A 00 13    TESTXI R10 0013
; D 4132 A0 06 64       IFTRUEI K_SAVE
; D 4135 86 0A 00 0C    TESTXI R10 000C
; D 4139 A0 06 D2       IFTRUEI K_LOAD
; D 413C 86 0A 00 0E    TESTXI R10 000E
; D 4140 A0 07 82       IFTRUEI K_NEW
; D 4143 86 0A 00 16    TESTXI R10 0016
; D 4147 A0 07 90       IFTRUEI K_REDRAW
; D 414A 86 0A 00 07    TESTXI R10 0007
; D 414E A0 07 96       IFTRUEI K_HELP
; D 4151 86 0A 00 18    TESTXI R10 0018
; D 4155 A0 07 A6       IFTRUEI K_EXIT
; D 4158 B0 00 5B       GAL MAIN
; K_ESC:
; D 415B 11 0C 00 FA    LOADXI R12 00FA
; D 415F BD 08 96       CALL N_K                           the rest of the sequence, if it comes within ~30 ms
; D 4162 8C 0A          TESTXZ R10
; D 4164 A0 00 5B       IFTRUEI MAIN                       Esc on its own: nothing
; D 4167 86 0A 00 5B    TESTXI R10 005B
; D 416B A0 01 8A       IFTRUEI ES2
; D 416E 86 0A 00 4F    TESTXI R10 004F
; D 4172 A0 01 8A       IFTRUEI ES2
; D 4175 11 09 00 41    LOADXI R9 0041
; D 4179 89 A9          TESTLXY R10 < R9
; D 417B A0 00 5B       IFTRUEI MAIN
; D 417E 11 09 00 45    LOADXI R9 0045
; D 4182 89 A9          TESTLXY R10 < R9
; D 4184 A0 01 91       IFTRUEI ARROWKEY                   ESC A-D: an arrow whose '[' was overwritten
; D 4187 B0 00 5B       GAL MAIN
; ES2:
; D 418A 11 0C 00 FA    LOADXI R12 00FA
; D 418E BD 08 96       CALL N_K
; ARROWKEY:
; D 4191 22 0A          COPYXA R10 -> Acc
; D 4193 2F 0B 1F A5    WRITEIDX R11 1FA5                  remember the arrow
; D 4197 86 0A 00 41    TESTXI R10 0041
; D 419B A0 04 91       IFTRUEI K_UP
; D 419E 86 0A 00 42    TESTXI R10 0042
; D 41A2 A0 04 9F       IFTRUEI K_DOWN
; D 41A5 86 0A 00 43    TESTXI R10 0043
; D 41A9 A0 04 6A       IFTRUEI K_RIGHT
; D 41AC 86 0A 00 44    TESTXI R10 0044
; D 41B0 A0 04 43       IFTRUEI K_LEFT
; D 41B3 86 0A 00 48    TESTXI R10 0048
; D 41B7 A0 04 AD       IFTRUEI K_HOME
; D 41BA 86 0A 00 46    TESTXI R10 0046
; D 41BE A0 04 B7       IFTRUEI K_END
; D 41C1 11 09 00 31    LOADXI R9 0031
; D 41C5 89 A9          TESTLXY R10 < R9
; D 41C7 A0 00 5B       IFTRUEI MAIN
; D 41CA 11 09 00 39    LOADXI R9 0039
; D 41CE 88 A9          TESTGXY R10 >= R9
; D 41D0 A0 00 5B       IFTRUEI MAIN
; D 41D3 23 00 AD       COPYXY R10 -> R13                  ESC [ n ~
; D 41D6 11 0C 00 FA    LOADXI R12 00FA
; D 41DA BD 08 96       CALL N_K
; D 41DD 86 0A 00 7E    TESTXI R10 007E
; D 41E1 A1 00 5B       IFFALSEI MAIN
; D 41E4 86 0D 00 31    TESTXI R13 0031
; D 41E8 A0 04 AD       IFTRUEI K_HOME
; D 41EB 86 0D 00 37    TESTXI R13 0037
; D 41EF A0 04 AD       IFTRUEI K_HOME
; D 41F2 86 0D 00 34    TESTXI R13 0034
; D 41F6 A0 04 B7       IFTRUEI K_END
; D 41F9 86 0D 00 38    TESTXI R13 0038
; D 41FD A0 04 B7       IFTRUEI K_END
; D 4200 86 0D 00 35    TESTXI R13 0035
; D 4204 A0 04 EF       IFTRUEI K_PGUP
; D 4207 86 0D 00 36    TESTXI R13 0036
; D 420B A0 05 2D       IFTRUEI K_PGDN
; D 420E 86 0D 00 33    TESTXI R13 0033
; D 4212 A0 03 CF       IFTRUEI K_DEL
; D 4215 B0 00 5B       GAL MAIN
; K_PRINT:
; D 4218 87 12          TESTXY R1 = R2
; D 421A A0 08 17       IFTRUEI DOCFULL                    no gap left
; D 421D BD 09 68       CALL ATEOL
; D 4220 51 15 08       SUBXYZ R1 - R5 -> R8               R8 = the column
; D 4223 8C 09          TESTXZ R9
; D 4225 A1 02 56       IFFALSEI PR_EOL                    R9 = 1: at the end of the line
; D 4228 BD 08 CC       CALL N_N                           RA = characters after the cursor on this line
; D 422B 50 8A 07       ADDXYZ R8 + R10 -> R7
; D 422E 11 09 00 4F    LOADXI R9 004F
; D 4232 88 79          TESTGXY R7 >= R9
; D 4234 A0 08 47       IFTRUEI LINELONG
; D 4237 BD 09 59       CALL SYNCIF
; D 423A BD 09 83       CALL INSCHAR
; D 423D 23 00 DA       COPYXY R13 -> R10
; D 4240 BD 08 84       CALL N_C                           the character
; D 4243 23 00 2A       COPYXY R2 -> R10
; D 4246 BD 08 A2       CALL N_L                           and the rest of the line after it
; D 4249 10 00 01       LOADAI 0001
; D 424C 2F 0B 1F A3    WRITEIDX R11 1FA3                  CDIRTY := 1
; D 4250 51 15 06       SUBXYZ R1 - R5 -> R6               the column Up/Down aim for
; D 4253 B0 00 5B       GAL MAIN
; PR_EOL:
; D 4256 11 09 00 48    LOADXI R9 0048
; D 425A 89 89          TESTLXY R8 < R9
; D 425C A1 02 71       IFFALSEI PR_WRAP                   at the margin: wrap
; D 425F BD 09 59       CALL SYNCIF
; D 4262 BD 09 83       CALL INSCHAR
; D 4265 23 00 DA       COPYXY R13 -> R10
; D 4268 BD 08 84       CALL N_C                           type: one byte out
; D 426B 51 15 06       SUBXYZ R1 - R5 -> R6               the column Up/Down aim for
; D 426E B0 00 5B       GAL MAIN
; PR_WRAP:
; D 4271 86 0D 00 20    TESTXI R13 0020
; D 4275 A0 02 F7       IFTRUEI K_ENTER                    a space at the margin is a new line
; D 4278 BD 08 D2       CALL N_P                           RA = the last space on this line
; D 427B 8C 0A          TESTXZ R10
; D 427D A0 02 B0       IFTRUEI PR_HARD
; D 4280 87 A5          TESTXY R10 = R5
; D 4282 A0 02 B0       IFTRUEI PR_HARD                    (not one at the very start)
; D 4285 23 00 A7       COPYXY R10 -> R7
; D 4288 10 00 0D       LOADAI 000D
; D 428B 2F 07 00 00    WRITEIDX R7 0000                   that space becomes the new line
; D 428F 51 34 0A       SUBXYZ R3 - R4 -> R10
; D 4292 42 0A          INCX R10
; D 4294 51 75 0C       SUBXYZ R7 - R5 -> R12
; D 4297 42 0C          INCX R12
; D 4299 BD 08 90       CALL N_G
; D 429C 11 0E 16 4E    LOADXI R14 164E                    erase the word from this line
; D 42A0 BD 08 7E       CALL N_S
; D 42A3 42 03          INCX R3
; D 42A5 23 00 75       COPYXY R7 -> R5
; D 42A8 42 05          INCX R5                            the new line starts after it
; D 42AA BD 09 83       CALL INSCHAR
; D 42AD B0 02 C1       GAL NEWROW
; PR_HARD:
; D 42B0 10 00 0D       LOADAI 000D
; D 42B3 2F 01 00 00    WRITEIDX R1 0000                   no space: break the word here
; D 42B7 42 01          INCX R1
; D 42B9 42 03          INCX R3
; D 42BB 23 00 15       COPYXY R1 -> R5
; D 42BE BD 09 83       CALL INSCHAR
; NEWROW:
; D 42C1 10 00 01       LOADAI 0001
; D 42C4 2F 0B 1F A0    WRITEIDX R11 1FA0                  MOD := 1
; D 42C8 51 15 06       SUBXYZ R1 - R5 -> R6               the column Up/Down aim for
; D 42CB 51 34 0A       SUBXYZ R3 - R4 -> R10
; D 42CE 42 0A          INCX R10
; D 42D0 11 08 00 18    LOADXI R8 0018
; D 42D4 89 A8          TESTLXY R10 < R8
; D 42D6 A1 02 F1       IFFALSEI NR_SCROLL
; D 42D9 11 0C 00 17    LOADXI R12 0017
; D 42DD BD 08 A8       CALL N_R                           repaint the rows below
; D 42E0 10 00 01       LOADAI 0001
; D 42E3 2F 0B 1F A2    WRITEIDX R11 1FA2                  SDIRTY := 1
; D 42E7 10 00 01       LOADAI 0001
; D 42EA 2F 0B 1F A3    WRITEIDX R11 1FA3                  CDIRTY := 1
; D 42EE B0 00 5B       GAL MAIN
; NR_SCROLL:
; D 42F1 BD 0A 04       CALL ENSURE
; D 42F4 B0 00 5B       GAL MAIN
; K_ENTER:
; D 42F7 87 12          TESTXY R1 = R2
; D 42F9 A0 08 17       IFTRUEI DOCFULL
; D 42FC BD 09 68       CALL ATEOL
; D 42FF 8C 09          TESTXZ R9
; D 4301 A1 03 0E       IFFALSEI EN1
; D 4304 BD 09 59       CALL SYNCIF
; D 4307 11 0E 16 4E    LOADXI R14 164E                    the rest of the line moves down
; D 430B BD 08 7E       CALL N_S
; EN1:
; D 430E 10 00 0D       LOADAI 000D
; D 4311 2F 01 00 00    WRITEIDX R1 0000
; D 4315 42 01          INCX R1
; D 4317 42 03          INCX R3
; D 4319 23 00 15       COPYXY R1 -> R5
; D 431C B0 02 C1       GAL NEWROW
; K_BKSP:
; D 431F 86 01 21 00    TESTXI R1 2100
; D 4323 A0 08 0D       IFTRUEI BEEP                       nothing before the cursor
; D 4326 43 01          DECX R1
; D 4328 2E 01 00 00    READIDX R1 0000
; D 432C 81 00 0D       TESTAI 000D
; D 432F A0 03 7C       IFTRUEI BK_JOIN
; D 4332 10 00 01       LOADAI 0001
; D 4335 2F 0B 1F A0    WRITEIDX R11 1FA0                  MOD := 1
; D 4339 BD 09 68       CALL ATEOL
; D 433C BD 09 3E       CALL CURPOS
; D 433F BD 08 90       CALL N_G
; D 4342 8C 09          TESTXZ R9
; D 4344 A0 03 62       IFTRUEI BK_MID                     R9 = 0: in the middle
; D 4347 11 0A 00 20    LOADXI R10 0020
; D 434B BD 08 84       CALL N_C                           blank the character
; D 434E 10 00 01       LOADAI 0001
; D 4351 2F 0B 1F A2    WRITEIDX R11 1FA2                  SDIRTY := 1
; D 4355 10 00 01       LOADAI 0001
; D 4358 2F 0B 1F A3    WRITEIDX R11 1FA3                  CDIRTY := 1
; D 435C 51 15 06       SUBXYZ R1 - R5 -> R6               the column Up/Down aim for
; D 435F B0 00 5B       GAL MAIN
; BK_MID:
; D 4362 23 00 2A       COPYXY R2 -> R10
; D 4365 BD 08 A2       CALL N_L                           close up the line
; D 4368 10 00 01       LOADAI 0001
; D 436B 2F 0B 1F A2    WRITEIDX R11 1FA2                  SDIRTY := 1
; D 436F 10 00 01       LOADAI 0001
; D 4372 2F 0B 1F A3    WRITEIDX R11 1FA3                  CDIRTY := 1
; D 4376 51 15 06       SUBXYZ R1 - R5 -> R6               the column Up/Down aim for
; D 4379 B0 00 5B       GAL MAIN
; BK_JOIN:
; D 437C 43 03          DECX R3
; D 437E BD 08 C6       CALL N_B                           R5 = the start of the line above
; D 4381 51 15 08       SUBXYZ R1 - R5 -> R8
; D 4384 BD 08 CC       CALL N_N
; D 4387 50 8A 07       ADDXYZ R8 + R10 -> R7
; D 438A 11 09 00 50    LOADXI R9 0050
; D 438E 89 79          TESTLXY R7 < R9
; D 4390 A0 03 9D       IFTRUEI BJ_OK
; D 4393 42 01          INCX R1
; D 4395 42 03          INCX R3
; D 4397 BD 08 C6       CALL N_B
; D 439A B0 08 47       GAL LINELONG
; BJ_OK:
; D 439D 10 00 01       LOADAI 0001
; D 43A0 2F 0B 1F A0    WRITEIDX R11 1FA0                  MOD := 1
; D 43A4 51 15 06       SUBXYZ R1 - R5 -> R6               the column Up/Down aim for
; D 43A7 89 34          TESTLXY R3 < R4
; D 43A9 A1 03 B2       IFFALSEI BJ_R
; D 43AC BD 0A 83       CALL RECENTER
; D 43AF B0 00 5B       GAL MAIN
; BJ_R:
; D 43B2 51 34 0A       SUBXYZ R3 - R4 -> R10
; D 43B5 42 0A          INCX R10
; D 43B7 11 0C 00 17    LOADXI R12 0017
; D 43BB BD 08 A8       CALL N_R
; D 43BE 10 00 01       LOADAI 0001
; D 43C1 2F 0B 1F A2    WRITEIDX R11 1FA2                  SDIRTY := 1
; D 43C5 10 00 01       LOADAI 0001
; D 43C8 2F 0B 1F A3    WRITEIDX R11 1FA3                  CDIRTY := 1
; D 43CC B0 00 5B       GAL MAIN
; K_DEL:
; D 43CF 86 02 30 00    TESTXI R2 3000
; D 43D3 A0 08 0D       IFTRUEI BEEP                       nothing after the cursor
; D 43D6 2E 02 00 00    READIDX R2 0000
; D 43DA 81 00 0D       TESTAI 000D
; D 43DD A0 04 06       IFTRUEI DL_JOIN
; D 43E0 42 02          INCX R2
; D 43E2 10 00 01       LOADAI 0001
; D 43E5 2F 0B 1F A0    WRITEIDX R11 1FA0                  MOD := 1
; D 43E9 BD 09 3E       CALL CURPOS
; D 43EC BD 08 90       CALL N_G
; D 43EF 23 00 2A       COPYXY R2 -> R10
; D 43F2 BD 08 A2       CALL N_L
; D 43F5 10 00 01       LOADAI 0001
; D 43F8 2F 0B 1F A2    WRITEIDX R11 1FA2                  SDIRTY := 1
; D 43FC 10 00 01       LOADAI 0001
; D 43FF 2F 0B 1F A3    WRITEIDX R11 1FA3                  CDIRTY := 1
; D 4403 B0 00 5B       GAL MAIN
; DL_JOIN:
; D 4406 51 15 08       SUBXYZ R1 - R5 -> R8
; D 4409 42 02          INCX R2
; D 440B BD 08 CC       CALL N_N
; D 440E 50 8A 07       ADDXYZ R8 + R10 -> R7
; D 4411 11 09 00 50    LOADXI R9 0050
; D 4415 89 79          TESTLXY R7 < R9
; D 4417 A0 04 1F       IFTRUEI DJ_OK
; D 441A 43 02          DECX R2
; D 441C B0 08 47       GAL LINELONG
; DJ_OK:
; D 441F 10 00 01       LOADAI 0001
; D 4422 2F 0B 1F A0    WRITEIDX R11 1FA0                  MOD := 1
; D 4426 51 34 0A       SUBXYZ R3 - R4 -> R10
; D 4429 42 0A          INCX R10
; D 442B 11 0C 00 17    LOADXI R12 0017
; D 442F BD 08 A8       CALL N_R
; D 4432 10 00 01       LOADAI 0001
; D 4435 2F 0B 1F A2    WRITEIDX R11 1FA2                  SDIRTY := 1
; D 4439 10 00 01       LOADAI 0001
; D 443C 2F 0B 1F A3    WRITEIDX R11 1FA3                  CDIRTY := 1
; D 4440 B0 00 5B       GAL MAIN
; K_LEFT:
; D 4443 86 01 21 00    TESTXI R1 2100
; D 4447 A0 00 5B       IFTRUEI MAIN
; D 444A 43 01          DECX R1
; D 444C 43 02          DECX R2
; D 444E 2E 01 00 00    READIDX R1 0000
; D 4452 21 09          COPYAX Acc -> R9
; D 4454 2F 02 00 00    WRITEIDX R2 0000                   one character across the gap
; D 4458 86 09 00 0D    TESTXI R9 000D
; D 445C A1 04 64       IFFALSEI LF1
; D 445F 43 03          DECX R3
; D 4461 BD 08 C6       CALL N_B
; LF1:
; D 4464 51 15 06       SUBXYZ R1 - R5 -> R6               the column Up/Down aim for
; D 4467 B0 04 DB       GAL MOVED
; K_RIGHT:
; D 446A 86 02 30 00    TESTXI R2 3000
; D 446E A0 00 5B       IFTRUEI MAIN
; D 4471 2E 02 00 00    READIDX R2 0000
; D 4475 21 09          COPYAX Acc -> R9
; D 4477 2F 01 00 00    WRITEIDX R1 0000
; D 447B 42 01          INCX R1
; D 447D 42 02          INCX R2
; D 447F 86 09 00 0D    TESTXI R9 000D
; D 4483 A1 04 8B       IFFALSEI RT1
; D 4486 42 03          INCX R3
; D 4488 23 00 15       COPYXY R1 -> R5
; RT1:
; D 448B 51 15 06       SUBXYZ R1 - R5 -> R6               the column Up/Down aim for
; D 448E B0 04 DB       GAL MOVED
; K_UP:
; D 4491 11 0A 00 01    LOADXI R10 0001
; D 4495 11 0C 00 00    LOADXI R12 0000
; D 4499 BD 08 B4       CALL N_V
; D 449C B0 04 DB       GAL MOVED
; K_DOWN:
; D 449F 11 0A 00 01    LOADXI R10 0001
; D 44A3 11 0C 00 01    LOADXI R12 0001
; D 44A7 BD 08 B4       CALL N_V
; D 44AA B0 04 DB       GAL MOVED
; K_HOME:
